demy/question-capture/14052682/assets/b93bb91dae85a3e3b40a8d0ade3d4f420064aaa6926431fa7f664c977bb8fd59.png)\n\nTherefore, the matrix represents the reflection across the $x$-axis."]] "immutable_answers" [] "immutable_fields" [] "no_history" []}
